{"id":"0b39f28135327595","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-ip.md","title":"df-ip (Interactive Proof Class IP)","display":"df-ip (Interactive Proof Class IP)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]"],"display":"df-ip (Interactive Proof Class IP)","label":"28-df-ip","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-ip","IP","Interactive Proof Class"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 8.6","source_printed_pages":"146–147","source_pdf_pages":"172–173","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ip (Interactive Proof Class IP)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-ip"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-ip</span><span>IP</span><span>Interactive Proof Class</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 8.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"146–147"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"172–173"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IV}\">\\(\\mathsf{IV}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Strat}_b\">\\(\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\">\\(V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{IP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ [\\;&amp;\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge2/3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{IP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ [\\;&amp;\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge2/3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>证明者只见自己的输入及此前消息；验证者的私有随机带不作为证明者参数。固定一条全局诚实策略可将逐输入存在的诚实策略拼成一个函数，不限制其计算能力。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.6，印刷页 146–147；PDF 页 172–173。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{IV}$、$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$、$\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]；$V=(k,b,p,Q,D)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{IV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Strat}_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}","display":false},{"tex":"V=(k,b,p,Q,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{IP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ [\\;&\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge2/3\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1418,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"交互协议：[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]、[[28-df-completeness-soundness]]、[[28-df-ip]]、[[28-df-am]]、[[28-df-ma]]、[[28-df-mip]]。"},{"id":"e4bbd2ac00e2ea21","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"433dd7d4f3bb14c3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{IP}$ 见 [[28-df-ip]]；$\\mathsf{IV}$、$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$ 与接受概率见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。"}],"outgoing":["3e270c20bc5033b3"]}